---
import HallOfFameFeature from '../components/HallOfFameFeature.astro';
import OpportunityDiagram from '../components/OpportunityDiagram.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import Heading from '../components/Heading.astro';import projects from '../data/projects.json';import {path} from '../lib/site';
const roles=[['Culture Timing','AI, Product & Strategy Architect','Product architecture, the Nature Nurture Assessment platform, and work with company leadership on technology and business strategy.'],['Dr. Shika Academy','DevOps Intern','Website architecture, accessible web experiences, content organization, and digital infrastructure.'],['Mason High School Experiential Learning','Cybersecurity Industry Manager','Industry engagement and educational opportunities connecting students with cybersecurity professionals.'],['Denimrush','Business Analyst','Operational analysis, business research, and strategic decision support.'],['Finacle Soft Inc.','Lead Project Intern, Project Mrader360','Enterprise project work and cybersecurity analysis.'],['Camp Invention','Leadership Intern Lead','Supporting younger students through STEM activities, collaborative projects, and daily programming.']];
---
<Base title="Leadership"><Heading label="Make room for others" title="The work behind the title." description="Product decisions, editorial standards, conference debates, program operations: different settings have asked me to lead in different ways."/><HallOfFameFeature/><section class="section"><div class="two-col"><h2>Guide. Connect.<br/>Then listen again.</h2><div><p>At Venture Studio, a student’s idea could need expertise I did not have. At Uplift, a volunteer needed to understand how their contribution fit into the program. Those experiences taught me to respond to the person and the situation.</p><p>I am learning to balance initiative with listening, and ambition with the practical work of following through.</p></div></div></section><OpportunityDiagram/><section class="section"><h2>Leadership through the work.</h2>{projects.map(p=><article class="list-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">{p.area}</p><h3>{p.title}</h3></div><div><p>{p.contribution}</p><a class="small-link" href={path(`projects/${p.slug}/`)}>Read the account →</a></div></article>)}</section><section class="section"><h2>Diplomacy & student communities.</h2><div class="two-col"><div><h3>Model United Nations</h3><p>I cochaired the Security Council and supported conference operations at GUAMUN in January 2024. Across Model UN experiences, I practiced research, negotiation, fair participation, and public speaking.</p></div><div><h3>National Economics Club</h3><p>As president of the National Economics Club, I worked on recruitment, economic education, and preparation for the National Economics Challenge and National Personal Finance Challenge.</p></div></div></section><section class="section"><h2 id="professional-experience">Professional experience.</h2><p>My experience spans product strategy, technology, business analysis, and educational programming.</p>{roles.map(([org,role,text])=><article class="list-row"><div><h3>{org}</h3><span class="meta">{role}</span></div><p>{text}</p></article>)}</section><section class="section"><h2>Lessons in leadership.</h2><div class="two-col"><article><h3>Listen before deciding.</h3><p>Feedback on MindMate helped me reconsider assumptions and recognize where professional expertise was needed.</p><a href={path('journal/building-with-feedback/')}>Read the reflection →</a></article><article><h3>Give others room to contribute.</h3><p>At Venture Studio, useful support could mean a question, a next step, or a mentor connection. My autobiography explores what those moments taught me.</p><a href={path('about/#lead')}>Read the leadership chapter →</a></article></div></section><a href={path('journal/?category=Speaking')}>Speaking & public communication →</a></Base>
